This repository contains the engine that reads clinical guidelines. It does not
contain, and does not grant any right to, the guidelines themselves.

  KDIGO 2024 Clinical Practice Guideline for the Evaluation and Management of
  Chronic Kidney Disease
      © Kidney Disease: Improving Global Outcomes (KDIGO).
      Obtain from kdigo.org under KDIGO's terms.

  NICE NG203, Chronic kidney disease: assessment and management
      © National Institute for Health and Care Excellence.
      Obtain from nice.org.uk under the NICE UK Open Content Licence, which
      restricts commercial reuse and requires attribution.

An operator supplies their own licensed copies. `.gitignore` and `.dockerignore`
exclude the source PDFs and everything derived closely from them -- parsed
pages, chunk files, the record store, generated question expansions, and any
index built over them -- because those are the guideline text in another shape.

There is no exception. `reports/presentation.html` and
`reports/citation_highlight_demo.png` formerly embedded small cropped images of
guideline pages, used to illustrate how citations resolve to a bounding box.
Both have been removed and the history rewritten, so no guideline excerpt
remains in this repository or in any earlier commit of it.


